 "text": "Hey there! How's your day? Let the person choose. Ask her where she'd like to go, and be excited when she says yes. It' okay not to know yet. Maybe ask her about her favorite food or movie, then you can suggest something based on that. Sure thing. So, on Saturday, any thoughts on where to go? That' decent warning. You could plan something for lunch time. No problem. If you want to keep the day open, ask her what she'd like. Good. Just tell her to choose somewhere she can walk to, so it's walkable for both of you. Then order in dinner and pick place that's not too far. Most places deliver.",
